store.ts FAKE_INSTALL_STAGES / FAKE_UPDATE_STAGES:
- System packages → 系统依赖
- Python environment → Python 环境
- WENSHU repository → WENSHU 源码仓库
- Python dependencies → Python 依赖
- Node runtime → Node 运行时
- Desktop app → 桌面应用
- Preparing to update → 准备更新
- Downloading the latest version → 下载最新版本
- Rebuilding the desktop app → 重新构建桌面应用
- Installing the update → 安装更新

failure.tsx 错误信息翻中文:
- 'Update didn't finish' → '更新未完成' / 'Install didn't finish' → '安装未完成'
- 'Something went wrong during the update/installation' → '更新/安装过程中出现错误'
- 'Retry update/install' → '重试更新/安装'

bootstrap.rs install 错误消息中文 (UI 报错用, 不是 code logic):
- launch_hermes_desktop error: 找不到文枢桌面应用 → 中文提示
保留: launch_hermes_desktop function name, hermes_desktop CLI 命令

装机 user 7/24 17:50 拍板

code IDs 全保留:
- HERMES_HOME env var
- hermes_bootstrap_lib
- hermes_home() / launch_hermes_desktop() function names
